All 10 worst-cell regressions are on `0369d229ba4c` — smooth
photographic content where the WP-fixed DC tree's `Predictor::Weighted`
was a strong fit and gradient-residual prediction is much worse.
Follow-on: WP-residual learning + per-leaf `Predictor::Weighted` should
close this cluster.

