## Reproducer

```bash
# Build baseline (main):
cd /home/lilith/work/zen/jxl-encoder
git checkout c48c50be
cargo build --release --bin cjxl-rs

# Build new path (W44-54):
cd /home/lilith/work/zen/jxl-encoder--w44-54-dc-learn-tree
cargo build --release --bin cjxl-rs

